@startuml sequence_open
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Notes - Open Note via Title Link (post-migration)

actor User
participant "<a [routerLink]>" as Link
participant "Angular Router" as R
participant "EditNotePageComponent" as Edit
participant "NotesService" as Svc
participant "Backend API" as API

User -> Link: click title
Link -> R: navigate(['/notes', slug])
R -> Edit: activate with :slug param
Edit -> Svc: getBySlug(slug)
Svc -> API: GET /api/v1.0/notes/by-slug/{slug}
API --> Svc: 200 note
Svc --> Edit: note
Edit --> User: editor mounts with note content

@enduml
